{"id":1743,"date":"2025-03-31T16:11:19","date_gmt":"2025-03-31T16:11:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=1743"},"modified":"2025-03-31T17:26:09","modified_gmt":"2025-03-31T17:26:09","slug":"welcome-to-arkhamhorror-com","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/welcome-to-arkhamhorror-com\/","title":{"rendered":"Welcome to ArkhamHorror.com"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Astute Investigators among you have found your way here already, but now it&#8217;s time to throw the doors wide open\u2026&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Welcome to ArkhamHorror.com \u2013 the new home of all things Arkham Horror online. Here we&#8217;ll be bringing all the latest news from the studios behind the Arkham Horror series of games \u2013 Fantasy Flight Games, Edge Studio, and Z-Man Games \u2013 as well as our friends Loot Studios, Gamegenic and more, all in one place. On top of this, we&#8217;ll be bringing you regular, brand-new tales of mystery, horror and adventure from Aconyte Books, and a lot more besides.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Already on the site, as well as catching up on all the latest news, you can <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/web-fiction\/tales-from-nevermore-lovelorn\/\">read the first story<\/a> from Arkham&#8217;s infamous weird fiction magazine, <em>Tales of Nevermore<\/em>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/web-fiction\/the-arkham-advertiser-1\/\">pick up a copy of the <em>Arkham Advertiser<\/em><\/a>,  and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/story\/lore\/\">discover legend-haunted Arkham<\/a> in our Lore pages. <\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-simple-image-1e7VmB wp-block-lazyblock-simple-image\">\n<section class=\"simple-image flex justify-center items-center w-full py-[75px]\">\n            <div class=\"container simple-width relative max-w-[800px] w-full mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/products\/background_thumbnail.png\"\n                     class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center rotate-3\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/products\/thumbnail.png\"\n                     class=\"absolute w-full z-10 thumbnail_news\" style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px; transform: rotate(1deg);\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/image-converter\/2025\/03\/Screenshot-2025-03-27-at-14.51.33.webp\"\n                     class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover rotate-1 thumbnail_bg\"\n                     style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px;\">\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section><\/div>\n\n\n<p>This website is brand new, and will be growing fast. We&#8217;ll be bringing you regular news, stories and other updates, and also fleshing out our Lore pages with more investigators, monsters and locations, so check back and watch these grow over time. <\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-simple-image-26cOoE wp-block-lazyblock-simple-image\">\n<section class=\"simple-image flex justify-center items-center w-full py-[75px]\">\n            <div class=\"container simple-width relative max-w-[800px] w-full mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/products\/background_thumbnail.png\"\n                     class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center rotate-3\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/products\/thumbnail.png\"\n                     class=\"absolute w-full z-10 thumbnail_news\" style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px; transform: rotate(1deg);\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/image-converter\/2025\/03\/Screenshot-2025-03-27-at-14.52.17.webp\"\n                     class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover rotate-1 thumbnail_bg\"\n                     style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px;\">\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section><\/div>\n\n\n<p>To make sure you don&#8217;t miss anything, you can <a href=\"https:\/\/newsletter.asmodee.net\/arkhamhorror\">sign up for the Arkham Horror newsletter<\/a>, follow us on <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?id=61573969363057\">Facebook<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/arkhamhorrorofficial\/\">Instagram<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/x.com\/ArkhamHorrorOff\">X (formerly Twitter)<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/bsky.app\/profile\/arkhamhorror.bsky.social\">BlueSky<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@ArkhamHorrorOfficial\">subscribe to our YouTube channel<\/a>, and \u2013&nbsp;most importantly \u2013 check back often because we&#8217;ll be posting new content regularly. <\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1296,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"key-tag":[],"class_list":["post-1743","news","type-news","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v22.3 (Yoast SEO v22.9) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Welcome to ArkhamHorror.com | ArkhamHorror.com | The Official Arkham Horror Website News<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/welcome-to-arkhamhorror-com\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Welcome to ArkhamHorror.com | ArkhamHorror.com | The Official Arkham Horror Website News\" \/>\n<meta p